    [
     1,
     "<div>Hi Mikko and thank you for your prompt reply. Here are the two links. But the two models are not using the same dataset, so they&#39;re not comparable. However, given that they&#39;re provided as examples of the &quot;official&quot; tutorial, it&#39;s kind of confusing what a good fit is. Should our goal be the rejection of the null or not? Is there any rule of thumb for the value of P (chi-square test) that is considered acceptable?<br></div><div><a href=\"https://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/cfa.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/cfa.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792417672786000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3yJ1bVgRwnLxSHSolHlvht\">https://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/cfa.html</a></div><div><a href=\"https://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/sem.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/sem.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792417672786000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3sPklCLlXVxxtv35C8XPXl\">https://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/sem.html</a></div><div><br></div><div>thanks</div><div>Socrates<br></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div><br></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Wednesday, June 8, 2022 at 2:46:57 AM UTC-4 <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mikko....@jyu.fi</a> wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"en-FI\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Hi,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Can you link to the examples? SEM model is typically nested in CFA and should not fit better than the CFA model.\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Mikko<u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div><div lang=\"en-FI\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #b5c4df 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:36.0pt\">\r\n<b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black\">From: </span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black\"><a rel=\"nofollow\">lav...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">lav...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt; on behalf of Socrates Dimitriadis &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">em...@socrates.name</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Date: </b>Wednesday, 8. June 2022 at 8.57<br>\r\n<b>To: </b>lavaan &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">lav...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject: </b>goodness of fit<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Hello everyone,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">I&#39;m new to lavaan (and SEM in general) so I went through the tutorial and I see that in the CFA example the chi-square has a value of 85.306 (df=24, P=0.000) while in the SEM example\r\n the chi-square has a value of 38.125 (df=35, P=0.329). Does this mean that in the CFA we reject the null hypothesis and in the SEM we don&#39;t? Thus, can we say that the SEM model has a good fit but the CFA doesn&#39;t?<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">I would appreciate any help understanding how the goodness of fit works in these two cases.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Thank you!<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></div><div lang=\"en-FI\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">--\r\n<br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;lavaan&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a rel=\"nofollow\">lavaan+un...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://eur03.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgroups.google.com%2Fd%2Fmsgid%2Flavaan%2F5aac5871-dc63-4712-bf35-ba0b6672dbb9n%2540googlegroups.com%3Futm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;data=05%7C01%7C%7C5c5cfdd729dd4b1d06ff08da4913982b%7Ce9662d58caa44bc1b138c8b1acab5a11%7C1%7C0%7C637902646681289242%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=jVcIBlDV0vISEafCtZ8tB21f3oP8O5i95qXi7SEgmnM%3D&amp;reserved=0\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://eur03.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fgroups.google.com%252Fd%252Fmsgid%252Flavaan%252F5aac5871-dc63-4712-bf35-ba0b6672dbb9n%252540googlegroups.com%253Futm_medium%253Demail%2526utm_source%253Dfooter%26data%3D05%257C01%257C%257C5c5cfdd729dd4b1d06ff08da4913982b%257Ce9662d58caa44bc1b138c8b1acab5a11%257C1%257C0%257C637902646681289242%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%253D%257C3000%257C%257C%257C%26sdata%3DjVcIBlDV0vISEafCtZ8tB21f3oP8O5i95qXi7SEgmnM%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792417672787000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3SkYFNIjpZ1kJ0BAt5a9Iy\">\r\nhttps://groups.google.com/d/msgid/lavaan/5aac5871-dc63-4712-bf35-ba0b6672dbb9n%40googlegroups.com</a>.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</blockquote></div>"
